# Principles

Hub. Детали — по таблице; не дублировать codestyle / exceptions / design.

| Задача | Rule |
|---|---|
| Слои, decision tree, dependency | `architecture-core.mdc` |
| asmdef, DI, feature slice, эталон фичи | `architecture-reference.mdc` |
| Классы | `class-design.mdc` |
| Методы | `method-design.mdc` |
| Переменные | `variable-design.mdc` |
| Формат, naming, async | `codestyle.mdc` |
| Typed exceptions | `exceptions.mdc` |
| Unity сцена/prefab | `unity-mcp.mdc` |
| C# rename/format | `rider-mcp.mdc` |
